```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Member starts dental enrollment assistant] --> B[Authenticate member and obtain consent]
    B --> C[Collect minimum enrollment context]

    C --> D{Enrollment opportunity?}
    D -->|2026 Open Season| E[Validate Open Season dates]
    D -->|Newly eligible or new hire| F[Validate 60-day window]
    D -->|Qualifying life event| G[Validate QLE type and permitted change]
    D -->|No qualifying event| H[Explain next enrollment opportunity]

    E --> I{Window valid?}
    F --> I
    G --> I
    I -->|No| H
    I -->|Yes| J[Deterministic eligibility check]

    J --> K{Eligibility established?}
    K -->|No| L[Explain reason or direct member to agency or BENEFEDS]
    K -->|Uncertain| M[Human eligibility review]
    K -->|Yes| N[Determine eligible household members]

    N --> O[Select enrollment type:
    Self Only / Self Plus One / Self and Family]
    O --> P{Duplicate FEDVIP dental coverage?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Resolve conflicting enrollment before continuing]
    P -->|No| R[Benefits Advisor ReAct subgraph]

    subgraph REACT[Bounded ReAct Benefits Advisor]
        R --> R1[Ask dental needs and preferences]
        R1 --> R2[Tool: check preferred dentist network]
        R2 --> R3[Tool: look up ZIP rating area]
        R3 --> R4[Tool: calculate High and Standard premiums]
        R4 --> R5[Tool: retrieve cited benefit comparison]
        R5 --> R6{Enough evidence?}
        R6 -->|No| R7[Ask one clarifying question]
        R7 --> R2
        R6 -->|Yes| R8[Recommend options with costs,
        tradeoffs and citations]
    end
    style REACT stroke:#ff0000,stroke-width:4px,stroke-dasharray:0

    R8 --> S[Deterministically validate recommendation,
    rates and citations]
    S --> T{Validation passes?}
    T -->|No| U[Correct data or route to human benefits adviser]
    T -->|Yes| V[Member reviews plan, enrollment type,
    dependents, premium and effective-date estimate]

    V --> W{Member confirms selection?}
    W -->|No| R1
    W -->|Yes| X[Generate enrollment handoff summary]

    X --> Y[Redirect to BENEFEDS.gov
    or provide BENEFEDS telephone enrollment]
    Y --> Z{BENEFEDS confirmation received?}
    Z -->|No| AA[Save incomplete status and follow-up instructions]
    Z -->|Yes| AB[Record confirmation reference and effective date]

    AB --> AC[Write immutable audit event]
    AA --> AC
    H --> AC
    L --> AC
    M --> AC
    Q --> AC
    U --> AC
    AC --> AD[End]
```
